<lb n="29"/>Erstlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zaigendt</unclear> sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einmündig</unclear> an, daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorschiner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haber</unclear>-
